Parameter Default Effect When to change <code>cache &lt;ttl&gt;</code> <code>30</code> s TTL for positive responses Increase to 300 s for stable external names; lower for rapid DNS changes <code>cache denial &lt;ttl&gt;</code> <code>5</code> s TTL for NXDOMAIN responses Raise to 30 s to reduce negative-query flood from bad hostnames <code>forward . &lt;addr&gt;</code> Node <code>/etc/resolv.conf</code> Upstream DNS server Point to corporate resolver or Route53 for split-horizon DNS <code>health :8080</code> port 8080 HTTP health probe Change port if 8080 conflicts with other workloads <code>prometheus :9153</code> port 9153 Metrics scrape endpoint Standard; leave unless you remap ports <code>reload</code> 30 s Corefile hot-reload interval Lower for faster config changes in dev <p>Stub zone (forward a corporate domain to a private resolver): <pre><code>corp.internal:53 {
    forward . 10.100.0.53
    cache 30
}
</code></pre></p> <p>Hosts override (static entry): <pre><code>.:53 {
    hosts {
        10.100.0.5  legacy.corp.internal
        fallthrough
    }
    # rest of config...
}
</code></pre></p>
